  "variants": {
    "loosed": {
      "description": "The barb alone, in flight. Everything the bow was is gone from it, because the bow did not come — that is the whole point of there being two animals. Recentred on its own body: the canvas was sized for a pair, so left where it was strung it would fly a third of a body off its own hitbox.",
